{start_of_verse: Verse 1}
[Ab]Jesus [Eb7]calls us o'er the [Ab]tumult of [Abaug]our[Db]life's wild, restless [C]sea;
[F7]Day by [Bb]day [Bb7]his [Eb7]sweet voice [Ab]soundeth, [Ab7]saying, "[Db]Christian, [Eb7]follow [Ab]me!"
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_verse: Verse 2}
[Ab]Jesus [Eb7]calls [Ab]us [Abaug]from [Db]the [C]worship
[F7][Bb]of [Bb7]the [Eb7][Ab]vain [Ab7]world's [Db][Eb7]golden [Ab]store,
[Ab]from [Eb7]each [Ab]idol [Abaug]that [Db]would [C]keep us,
[F7][Bb]saying, [Bb7][Eb7]"Christian, [Ab][Ab7]love [Db][Eb7]me [Ab]more!"
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_verse: Verse 3}
[Ab]In [Eb7]our [Ab]joys [Abaug]and [Db]in [C]our sorrows,
[F7][Bb]days [Bb7]of [Eb7]toil [Ab][Ab7]and [Db]hours [Eb7]of [Ab]ease,
[Ab]still [Eb7]he [Ab]calls, [Abaug]in [Db]cares [C]and pleasures,
[F7][Bb]"Christian, [Bb7]love [Eb7][Ab]me [Ab7]more [Db][Eb7]than [Ab]these!"
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_verse: Verse 4}
[Ab]Jesus [Eb7]calls [Ab]us! [Abaug]By [Db]thy [C]mercies,
[F7][Bb]Savior, [Bb7]may [Eb7][Ab]we [Ab7]hear [Db][Eb7]thy [Ab]call,
[Ab]give [Eb7]our [Ab]hearts [Abaug]to [Db]thine [C]obedience,
[F7][Bb]serve [Bb7]and [Eb7]love [Ab][Ab7]thee [Db]best [Eb7]of [Ab]all.
{end_of_verse}
